+## Recipes
+
+### Keep a discovery response compact
+
+```bash
+tabelog-pp-cli find --area tokyo --cuisine bar --meal dinner --budget-max 5000 --limit 5 --agent --select items.id,items.name,items.rating,items.url
+```
+
+Project candidate identity, rating and links while retaining essential provenance and coverage metadata.
+
+### Compare saved candidates offline
+
+```bash
+tabelog-pp-cli lists compare tokyo-bars --agent
+```
+
+View saved facts and notes together; separate meal budgets and unknowns remain visible.
+
+### Refresh one saved candidate
+
+```bash
+tabelog-pp-cli lists refresh tokyo-bars 13005012 --agent
+```
+
+Fetch current detail facts for this ID, report changes and preserve its note and last valid snapshot on failure.
+
+### Find a factual saved backup
+
+```bash
+tabelog-pp-cli lists alternatives tokyo-bars --for 13005012 --match area,category --meal dinner --budget-max 5000 --agent
+```
+
+Match only within the saved set using verified area/category and a known cached dinner-bracket upper bound.
+
+### Audit evidence before more fetching
+
+```bash
+tabelog-pp-cli lists audit tokyo-bars --require hours,payment,reservation,dinner_budget --max-age 24h --agent
+```
+
+Distinguish details not fetched, source-unknown values and old snapshots without network calls.
